---
const razonesImgUrl = "/razones.jpg";
---

<section id="razones" data-reveal="up" class="relative">
  {/* Glow suave general */}
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-70" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute -top-10 left-1/2 h-72 w-72 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#6D5EF7]/10 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#FF7CC8]/10 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] md:items-center">
    {/* DERECHA: título (mismo estilo que “¿Qué es la terapia?”) */}
    <div
      class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-end md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1"
      data-reveal="right"
    >
      <h3
        class="text-center md:text-right font-serif font-black tracking-tight leading-[1.05]
               text-[34px] sm:text-[44px] md:text-[5rem]
               title-silhouette-sharp title-silhouette-sharp-anim"
      >
        ¿Por qué iniciar terapia?
      </h3>
    </div>

    {/* CENTRO: texto */}
    <div
      class="rounded-3xl bg-white/70 p-6 ring-1 ring-black/5 shadow-sm
             transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1
             md:col-start-2 md:row-start-1"
      data-reveal="up"
    >
      <ul
        data-reveal-item
        style="transition-delay: 140ms"
        class="space-y-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B6B6B]"
      >
        <li class="group flex gap-3 rounded-2xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#6D5EF7]/5">
          <span class="bullet mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D5EF7]"></span>
          <span>
            Porque <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">pedir ayuda</span> también es una forma de cuidarse.
          </span>
        </li>

        <li class="group flex gap-3 rounded-2xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#6D5EF7]/5">
          <span class="bullet mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D5EF7]"></span>
          <span>
            Porque no todo tiene que resolverse en <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">soledad</span>.
          </span>
        </li>

        <li class="group flex gap-3 rounded-2xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#6D5EF7]/5">
          <span class="bullet mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D5EF7]"></span>
          <span>
            Porque hablar con alguien que <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">escucha</span> puede abrir nuevas posibilidades.
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div
        data-reveal-item
        style="transition-delay: 260ms"
        class="mt-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/85 p-6 ring-1 ring-black/5 shadow-sm
               transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[#2E2E2E]">
          <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-black text-[#FF4FB6]">
            La terapia no es una exigencia
          </span>
          , es una oportunidad.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* IZQUIERDA: foto */}
    <div
      class="mt-8 justify-self-end md:mt-0 md:col-start-1 md:row-start-1 md:justify-self-start md:self-center"
      data-reveal="left"
    >
      <div
        class="relative inline-block w-[220px] sm:w-[240px] md:w-[240px] lg:w-[280px] xl:w-[320px] overflow-visible rounded-[14px] bg-white p-2
               shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12),0_20px_50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.14)]
               [transform:rotate(var(--tilt))] transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-[250ms] ease-out
               hover:[transform:translateY(-2px)_rotate(calc(var(--tilt)*0.4))]
               before:content-[''] before:absolute before:-top-3 before:left-8 before:h-6 before:w-24 before:rounded-[6px]
               before:bg-gradient-to-br before:from-white/70 before:to-white/30 before:border before:border-white/60
               before:shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] before:backdrop-blur-[2px] before:rotate-[-8deg]
               before:z-20 before:pointer-events-none
               after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-3 after:right-8 after:h-6 after:w-24 after:rounded-[6px]
               after:bg-gradient-to-br after:from-white/70 after:to-white/30 after:border after:border-white/60
               after:shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] after:backdrop-blur-[2px] after:rotate-[7deg]
               after:z-20 after:pointer-events-none
               tilt-l"
      >
        <img
          src={razonesImgUrl}
          alt="Imagen de razones para iniciar terapia"
          class="block w-full rounded-[12px]"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
